pub theorem bb215ArithmeticFormulaTailCode_represents (E: set): $ bb215ArithmeticFormulaDepthTwoSat E bb215ArithmeticFormulaTailCode <-> bb215ArithmeticFormulaListTail (E @ 0) = E @ 1 $ = (named '(bitr bb215ArithmeticFormulaTailCode_satisfies bb215ArithmeticFormulaTailGraph_correct));

